    <name>Hospital Américo Boavida — Luanda</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hospital</b><br/>Principal hospital de referencia de la capital. Coordenada urbana aproximada.<br/><a href="https://theawakeman.github.io/africa2027/paises/angola/#logistica">Ver ficha completa</a> · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=-8.8147,13.2302">Google Maps</a>]]></description>
