    <description><![CDATA[<b>Consular</b><br/>41, Ismail Mohamed St., Zamalek, El Cairo. Tel. (0020) 227356437 · Emergencia consular 24h: (0020) 1223183783.<br/><a href="https://theawakeman.github.io/africa2027/paises/egipto/#logistica">Ver ficha completa</a> · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=30.0596,31.2233">Google Maps</a>]]></description>
